- `/search` is the primary public search surface.
- Map and sidebar interaction is smooth.
- Sidebar listing selection recenters the map and can open property previews.
- Premium terrain styling, contour treatment, and electric blue water are established design targets.
- `/api/search` returns source, `meta.source`, health, access level, active filters, bounds status, duration, returned count, mapped count, coordinate-filtered count, `meta.smoke`, and Typesense collection/query/filter/sort context.
